WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:00.763
Welcome.

2
00:00:00.763 --> 00:00:04.395
This is the technical deep
dive for Book 07 of the

3
00:00:04.395 --> 00:00:08.574
Federal Modernization
Workbook, PKI and Certificates.

4
00:00:08.574 --> 00:00:11.539
It's for the PKI engineers
and architects who will

5
00:00:11.539 --> 00:00:14.937
run the move off Active
Directory Certificate Services.

6
00:00:14.937 --> 00:00:16.500
It comes in two parts.

7
00:00:16.500 --> 00:00:21.053
Part 1 is hardening and the target:
how to make the AD CS that stays the

8
00:00:21.053 --> 00:00:23.004
best-defended system you own,

9
00:00:23.004 --> 00:00:26.825
then a target of four issuers
and one lifecycle platform.

10
00:00:26.825 --> 00:00:31.881
Part 2 is issuing, migrating and
retiring: Intune certificate profiles,

11
00:00:31.881 --> 00:00:37.538
strong mapping and Entra certificate-based
authentication, then coexistence,

12
00:00:37.538 --> 00:00:41.737
the six-wave migration, monitoring
and retiring the old CAs.

13
00:00:41.737 --> 00:00:44.725
The commands live in the
chapters and appendices,

14
00:00:44.725 --> 00:00:48.224
marked as illustrative and
untested against production.

15
00:00:48.224 --> 00:00:49.800
I'll stick to what matters.
